MAIN
MOVE TEMP 20 4
MOVE TEMP 21 HALLOCATE TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 4
MOVE TEMP 23 HALLOCATE TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 NestedTest_ved_TestNested
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 25
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 26 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 26
PRINT TEMP 4
END
NestedTest_ved_TestNested [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 27 4
MOVE TEMP 28 HALLOCATE TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 8
MOVE TEMP 30 HALLOCATE TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 31 TEMP 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 32 Math_ved_AddFive
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 Math_ved_Double
HSTORE TEMP 4 4 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 34 10
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 34
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
MOVE TEMP 35 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 5 )
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 35
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 36 CALL TEMP 10 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 8 )
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 11
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 37 10
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 37
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 38 CALL TEMP 14 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 12 )
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 38
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 16 0
MOVE TEMP 39 CALL TEMP 17 ( TEMP 1 TEMP 15 )
MOVE TEMP 18 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 18
PRINT TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 40 0
MOVE TEMP 19 TEMP 40

RETURN TEMP 19
END
Math_ved_AddFive [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 41 5
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 42 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 42

RETURN TEMP 3
END
Math_ved_Double [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 43 2
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 43
MOVE TEMP 44 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 44

RETURN TEMP 3
END

